temper (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * First release as temper, renamed from tempered (whose history is at
    https://github.com/charlieh0tel/tempered-hid): two packages, temper,
    the command-line tool (temper read, info, log), and temper-iio, the
    daemon that presents a TEMPerGold or TEMPerHUM as Linux IIO
    devices.  The daemon's unit, user, settings and links are now named
    temper-iio (temper-iio@, /etc/default/temper-iio with TEMPER_IIO_*
    settings, /run/temper-iio).

 -- Christopher Hoover <ch@murgatroid.com>  Wed, 07 Oct 2026 22:32:12 -0700
